# Flames for the Dead (battlefield.flames_for_the_dead#timeup): option 1, then the clock runs out through ticks
# (1202000, 300000, 240000, 30000, 20000, 10000 ms): message 7078, BLOWN_AWAY (7633, this fight's onBattlefieldLoss) and
# the loss event 32002; finish-if-event finishes it.
lists BearclawPinnacle/Wind_Pillar_1/onTrigger BearclawPinnacle/onEventUpdate/32000 BearclawPinnacle/onEventFinish/32000 BearclawPinnacle/onEventFinish/32001 BearclawPinnacle/onEventFinish/32002
char zone=BearclawPinnacle pos=-720,9,-441 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
mission Cop ThreePaths current
login
missionstatus Cop 8 pos=4               # a GM
trigger Wind_Pillar_1
update 32000 option=1
finish
tick 1202000
tick 300000
tick 240000
tick 30000
tick 20000
tick 10000
finish-if-event
